WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.121 --> 00:00:02.871
(dramatic music)

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.510
- [Narrator] There are those
who wake up every morning

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.100
to fight for a better world.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.300
They're not celebrities or politicians,

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.970
they're regular people.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:01.983
They are The Brave.

00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:09.059
(dramatic music)

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.610
(dramatic music)

